      "Treatment": "SOURCE_SCOPED_AUTHORING_WITH_TEACHER_REVIEW",
      "TestsExecuted": "NOT_RUN"
    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U06-L15-ACTIVITY-016",
      "SourceSection": "15.3: Double the Sine",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Another type of transformation is one that affects the period and that is when a horizontal scale factor is used. For example, let's look at the equation \\(y = \\cos(2\\theta)\\) where the variable \\(\\theta\\) is multiplied by a number. Here,…",
